# Upstream data-build cache (raw Wikidata SPARQL + pageviews responses, re-fetchable via
# v2/build/fetch.py). A build cache, not a result; never committed.
v2/cache/

# The committed run of record lives in v2/allband_predictions/ (the all-band 11-model
# per-item predictions + item metadata) with analysis in v2/build/ and reference macros in
# v2/allband/, so reviewers can regenerate every paper number without a GPU; keep it tracked.
